00:15:08,571 --> 00:15:14,571
White, who reveals that the organization that blackmailed Vesper is far
more complex and dangerous than anyone had imagined.

5
00:18:55,714 --> 00:19:01,714
James Bond, played by Daniel Craig.

6
00:22:42,857 --> 00:22:48,857
Camille, played by Olga Kurylenko.

7
